  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-587299837805069162 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/c80c08-d3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_STATIC&editorId=587299837704143722&sectionId=587299837805069162)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkL_vXdmlc_text","label":"ggkL_vXdmlc_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#5594E7;\"><strong>Do you have any questions? We’re happy to help! Email us at &nbsp;</strong></span><a href=\"mailto:info@Shopvetpets.com\"><span style=\"color:#5594E7;\"><strong>info@Shopvetpets.com</strong></span></a><br>&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7EExX0OcM_text","label":"gg7EExX0OcM_text","default":"<i>Why Thousands of Dog Owners Are Ditching Toothbrushes <strong>For This <u>30-Second Alternative</u></strong></i>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEKyY0SfQK_text","label":"ggEKyY0SfQK_text","default":"<p><strong>By Sarah Mitchell, Pet Health Contributor</strong><br>Updated January 2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV7Ed2OWVJ_text","label":"ggV7Ed2OWVJ_text","default":"<p><i>If you've ever tried brushing your dog's teeth, you know the struggle. <strong>The running. The hiding. The complete refusal to cooperate.</strong></i><br>&nbsp;</p><p><i>For years, <strong>Jennifer Thompson from Texas dealt with this same battle.&nbsp;</strong></i><br><br><i>'I'd spend 15 minutes chasing my dog around the house with a toothbrush,' she says.&nbsp;</i></p><p><i>'Eventually, I just... gave up.'</i></p><p><br><i>But when her vet warned about <strong>early signs of gum disease,</strong> Jennifer knew she couldn't ignore it anymore.&nbsp;</i><br><br><i>The bacteria wasn't just causing bad breath—it was spreading to vital organs.</i></p><p><br><i><strong>That's when she discovered something that changed everything!</strong></i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDBgWY8lT9_text","label":"ggDBgWY8lT9_text","default":"<span style=\"font-size:28px;\"><i>The Hidden Epidemic Affecting </i></span><span style=\"color:#EA2525;font-size:28px;\"><i>8 Out of 10 Dogs</i></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSrno-AKE3_text","label":"ggSrno-AKE3_text","default":"<p>Jennifer isn't alone.<strong> Studies show 87% of dog owners quit brushing within two weeks.</strong> The reason? Most dogs absolutely hate it.<br><br>'They see the toothbrush coming and they're gone,' explains veterinarian Dr. Rebecca Hayes, who's been practicing in California for over 15 years. 'Owners feel guilty, dogs are stressed, and the dental care just... doesn't happen.'</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglmADI1-jP_text","label":"gglmADI1-jP_text","default":"<p><strong>Meanwhile, gum disease affects 8 out of 10 dogs over age 3.</strong> Left untreated, bacteria from infected gums spread through the bloodstream to the heart, liver, and kidneys—<strong>shortening a dog's life by up to 3 years.</strong></p><p><br>'Most owners don't realize how serious this is,' Dr. Hayes continues. 'They think bad breath is normal<strong>. But it's actually the first warning sign</strong> of a disease that's silently damaging their dog's organs.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLtdPRxgvc_label","label":"ggLtdPRxgvc_label","default":"<p>Skip to Solution</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVBqjqzzWA_childItem_0","label":"ggVBqjqzzWA_childItem_0","default":"<p>Try Risk-Free • 100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_22YPeAPS_text","label":"gg_22YPeAPS_text","default":"The Alternative Vets Are <strong>Starting to Recommend</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvOzRX72Ip_text","label":"ggvOzRX72Ip_text","default":"<p>During a routine checkup, Dr. Hayes showed Jennifer an alternative: veterinary finger wipes <strong>specifically designed for dogs who refuse traditional brushing.</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I was skeptical,\" Jennifer admits. \"But the first time I tried it, my dog just... sat there. No running. No fighting. I couldn't believe it.\"<br>&nbsp;</p><p>The secret? The wipes slip onto your finger like a glove, giving you complete control. The textured surface mechanically removes plaque, while a <strong>vet-approved formula kills bacteria at the gum line.</strong><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Most importantly: dogs actually accept them.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWJTwbZG2J_text","label":"ggWJTwbZG2J_text","default":"<p>It makes sense when you think about it,' Dr. Hayes explains. \"Your finger is familiar to your dog. You can feel exactly where you're cleaning. And there's no scary foreign object coming at their face\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gga1s1BQP0V_label","label":"gga1s1BQP0V_label","default":"<p>Check Availability</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkKzlT_j9N_childItem_0","label":"ggkKzlT_j9N_childItem_0","default":"<p>Try Risk-Free • 100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8SRACmCQa_text","label":"gg8SRACmCQa_text","default":"<p>The first time Jennifer used the wipe, she was shocked by what came off her dog's teeth</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMUSzYyTHQ_text","label":"ggMUSzYyTHQ_text","default":"<p>\"I had no idea that was building up in there,\" she says. \"It was disgusting—but also proof that it was actually working.\"<br>&nbsp;</p><p>After just two weeks of using the wipes twice weekly, Jennifer's vet noticed a significant improvement. \"Her gums went from inflamed and red to healthy and pink,\" Dr. Hayes confirms.</p><p>The results were visible—and they happened fast.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVwhUctZh5_text","label":"ggVwhUctZh5_text","default":"<p>\"The dirty wipe was proof I needed to see. I was removing actual plaque every time. Within a month, her breath improved and the vet said her gums looked healthier than dogs half her age.\"<br><strong>— Amanda Richardson, Florida, USA</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggatCpvPna2_label","label":"ggatCpvPna2_label","default":"<p>Check avaliability</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg38t4UsYT6_childItem_0","label":"gg38t4UsYT6_childItem_0","default":"<p>Try Risk-Free • 100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</p>"}],
